{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"杰夫·贝佐斯·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"jeff-bezos","categoryLabel":"杰夫·贝佐斯","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/09_jeff-bezos/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷按编年顺序讲述杰夫·贝佐斯（1964— ）的人生历程：从新墨西哥州一个被领养的孩子，到普林斯顿工程系尖子生、华尔街量化基金高管，再到亚马逊创始人、蓝色起源掌门人与《华盛顿邮报》所有者。本卷的定位是<strong>事实编年与个人轨迹</strong>——回答&quot;他在何时、做了什么、为何如此选择&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷与兄弟卷的分工\">本卷与兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>这是理解整个贝佐斯文集的关键。本卷只负责&quot;生平时间线&quot;，刻意不展开他的方法论与业务机制，以避免和兄弟卷重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 生平与时代（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>何时、做了什么、为何选择</td>\n<td>编年事实与决策时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他改变了哪些行业（零售/云）</td>\n<td>业务的经济学与机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 理念与方法</a></td>\n<td>他如何思考与决策</td>\n<td>Day 1、两类门、working backwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 代表作</a></td>\n<td>他造出了什么（亚马逊/AWS/股东信）</td>\n<td>产物的深度剖析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他留下了什么影响</td>\n<td>长期与跨领域影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>该如何评判他</td>\n<td>劳工、垄断、富豪叙事的辩论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>约定：同一事实只在主篇展开。例如&quot;后悔最小化框架&quot;的生平场景在本卷讲，作为决策方法的系统分析归 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/decision-making/\">决策方法</a>；AWS 的上线时间在本卷，其技术与商业机制归 <a href=\"../core-contributions/aws-cloud-revolution/\">AWS 云革命</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构与推荐路径\">本卷结构与推荐路径</h2><p>本卷分三章，按时间推进，建议顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一章 早年与华尔街</strong> — <a href=\"early-life-and-wall-street/early-years\">早年与求学</a>（出身、领养、农场、普林斯顿）→ <a href=\"early-life-and-wall-street/wall-street-career\">华尔街生涯</a>（D.E. Shaw 与发现互联网）</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 创办亚马逊</strong> — <a href=\"founding-amazon/the-regret-minimization\">后悔最小化的抉择</a>（决策框架）→ <a href=\"founding-amazon/the-everything-store\">从书店到万物商店</a>（1994–2000 创业史）</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 帝国与太空</strong> — <a href=\"empire-and-space/building-an-empire\">商业帝国的崛起</a>（Prime/AWS/Kindle 与卸任 CEO）→ <a href=\"empire-and-space/blue-origin-and-beyond\">蓝色起源与晚年</a>（太空、慈善、个人生活）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无硬性前置。若对电商/云计算的商业概念完全陌生，可在读完本卷后再进 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完生平后，想深入&quot;他怎么想&quot;，去 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">理念与方法</a>；想要批判性视角，去 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>透过这条时间线，读者会看到一个反复出现的模式：贝佐斯总是把一次性的个人直觉，提炼成可复用的决策规则，并用长期主义为看似不理性的赌注辩护——这一模式既是他成功的引擎，也是争议的源头。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-wall-street","title":"早年与华尔街","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/early-life-and-wall-street","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-years","title":"早年与求学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/early-life-and-wall-street/early-years"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wall-street-career","title":"华尔街生涯","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/early-life-and-wall-street/wall-street-career"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-amazon","title":"创办亚马逊","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/founding-amazon","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-regret-minimization","title":"后悔最小化的抉择","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/founding-amazon/the-regret-minimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-everything-store","title":"从书店到万物商店","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/founding-amazon/the-everything-store"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"empire-and-space","title":"帝国与太空","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/empire-and-space","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"building-an-empire","title":"商业帝国的崛起","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/empire-and-space/building-an-empire"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blue-origin-and-beyond","title":"蓝色起源与晚年","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/life-and-times/empire-and-space/blue-origin-and-beyond"}]}]}